---
interface Props {
  translations: any;
}

const { translations } = Astro.props;
---

<section class="py-24">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-6">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 scroll-animate">
      <span class="inline-block px-4 py-1.5 bg-primary/10 text-primary rounded-full text-sm font-semibold mb-4" data-i18n="faq.label">FAQ</span>
      <h2 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold" data-i18n="faq.title">Common Questions</h2>
    </div>
    
    <div class="space-y-4" id="faq-list">
      <details class="group bg-white/3 border border-white/5 rounded-xl scroll-animate hover:bg-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-semibold faq-q group-hover:text-primary transition-colors" data-i18n="faq.questions.0.q">Is MiCash free to use?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-text-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-text-muted faq-a" data-i18n="faq.questions.0.a">
          Yes! MiCash is 100% free with no hidden fees, no premium versions, and no ads. We believe everyone should have access to simple financial tracking.
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <details class="group bg-white/3 border border-white/5 rounded-xl scroll-animate delay-100 hover:bg-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-semibold faq-q group-hover:text-primary transition-colors" data-i18n="faq.questions.1.q">Is my data safe?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-text-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-text-muted faq-a" data-i18n="faq.questions.1.a">
          Absolutely! All your data is stored locally on your device. We don't collect, store, or transmit any of your personal or financial information. Your data is 100% private.
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <details class="group bg-white/3 border border-white/5 rounded-xl scroll-animate delay-200 hover:bg-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-semibold faq-q group-hover:text-primary transition-colors" data-i18n="faq.questions.2.q">Why isn't MiCash on the Play Store?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-text-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-text-muted faq-a" data-i18n="faq.questions.2.a">
          We're currently in early development. The APK download allows us to iterate quickly and get feedback directly from users. We may release on the Play Store in the future!
        </div>
      </details>
      
      <details class="group bg-white/3 border border-white/5 rounded-xl scroll-animate delay-300 hover:bg-white/5 hover:border-white/10 transition-all">
        <summary class="flex items-center justify-between p-5 cursor-pointer list-none">
          <span class="font-semibold faq-q group-hover:text-primary transition-colors" data-i18n="faq.questions.3.q">Will MiCash work on my phone?</span>
          <svg class="faq-arrow w-5 h-5 text-text-muted group-open:rotate-180 transition-transform" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
            <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M19 9l-7 7-7-7"/>
          </svg>
        </summary>
        <div class="px-5 pb-5 text-text-muted faq-a" data-i18n="faq.questions.3.a">
          MiCash requires Android 7.0 (Nougat) or higher. Most Android phones from 2016 onwards are compatible. If you encounter any issues, please let us know!
        </div>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
